# Decision Integration

Purpose:
  Integrate decisions with chain graph and project execution.

Chain Integration:
  D0 -> D1 (docs) -> D0
    |
    v
  Decision: proposed
    |
    v
  Human approval
    |
    v
  Decision: approved
    |
    v
  D0 -> S1 (sdd) -> D0
    |
    v
  Task creation
    |
    v
  D0 -> C1 (code) -> D0
    |
    v
  Task completion
    |
    v
  Decision: implemented
    |
    v
  Verification
    |
    v
  Decision: verified
    |
    v
  D0 -> R1 (review) -> D0

Decision Events:
  DEC_PROPOSED:
    Trigger: AI or human creates decision
    Action: Create DEC-XXX.sdd
    Next: review

  DEC_APPROVED:
    Trigger: Human approves
    Action: Create tasks, update status
    Next: implemented

  DEC_REJECTED:
    Trigger: Human rejects
    Action: Record feedback, archive
    Next: archived

  DEC_IMPLEMENTED:
    Trigger: Tasks completed
    Action: Update status, run verification
    Next: verified

  DEC_VERIFIED:
    Trigger: Verification passes
    Action: Close decision
    Next: closed

  DEC_SUPERSEDED:
    Trigger: New decision approved
    Action: Update old decision, migrate tasks
    Next: archived

State: +
